.SH 説明
The functions \fBecvt_r\fP(), \fBfcvt_r\fP(), \fBqecvt_r\fP(), and \fBqfcvt_r\fP()  are
identical to \fBecvt\fP(3), \fBfcvt\fP(3), \fBqecvt\fP(3), and \fBqfcvt\fP(3),
respectively, except that they do not return their result in a static
buffer, but instead use the supplied \fIbuf\fP of size \fIsize\fP.  See \fBecvt\fP(3)
and \fBqecvt\fP(3).
